        <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Single use item.  While the model is on the board, one friendly unit within line of sight of the vehicle may re-roll a single morale test.  Must be represented on the model.  </characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
