          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>If the unit is held in Strategic Reserve, they can Deep Strike at the start of any friendly
turn. All weapons in the formation have the Shred special rule on the turn they Deep
Strike.</description>
