            <rule name="Praesidium Protectiva" id="f8c8-af13-6445-dd58" hidden="false">
              <description>A model equipped with a Praesidium Protectiva may take a 4+ Invulnerable save in an assault instead of her normal armour save. The save may only be used against one opponent per turn.</description>
